  "note": "Which knowledge base articles a module pulls in, projected out of the repository crosswalk for this package. `tag` is the module tag the articles carry in their frontmatter and in the digest of the instructions. `articles` are the numbers of that module's on-demand articles, without a language, because Czech and English are mirrored pairs: one article is `knowledge/ondemand/kb.<lang>.<number>.md`. `capability_keys` are keys of the capability registry the instructions embed, so a capability the story names finds its module; `web_slugs` and `aliases` are the other names the same module answers to. A module with no `articles` has none that load on demand; its articles are inlined in the instructions. The module ids of the internal layer are not here.",
  "schema_version": "1.0"
}
